        - Martin Bates: PhD project supervisor.
        - Paul Walton: PhD project supervisor.


                                 *** PARAMETER SPACE ***

=========================================================================================
                                     INPUT
=========================================================================================
MetalAssignment:
----------------
Field                Value
-------------------  ------------------------------------------------------
d_electrons          9
racah_b              Fixed(value=0.0)
racah_c              Fixed(value=0.0)
spin_orbit_coupling  Fixed(value=830.0)
kiso                 Varied(value=[0.3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.6, 0.7, 0.8, 0.9, 1.0])

LigandAssignment:
-----------------
Field    Value
-------  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
name     Cl
esigma   Varied(value=[6000.0, 6500.0, 7000.0, 7500.0, 8000.0])
epix     Varied(value=[900.0, 1000.0, 1100.0, 1200.0, 1300.0, 1400.0])
epiy     Link(object_reference='ligand.Cl.epix', link_type=<LinkType.LINEAR: 'linear'>, link_arguments={'gradient': 1.0, 'constant': 0.0})
edxy     Fixed(value=0.0)
edx2y2   Fixed(value=0.0)
eds      Varied(value=[1000.0, 1200.0, 1400.0])

